<title>AUSTRALIA: ANZ Bank says business tracking as expected.</title>
<headline>ANZ Bank says business tracking as expected.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australia and New Zealand Banking Group Ltd (ANZ) on Friday said its business was tracking as expected, with shrinking margins offsetting asset growth.</p>
<p>In documents released to the Australian Stock Exchange, ANZ also said direct income related costs were rising despite the bank's drive to lower costs.</p>
<p>But non-interest income continues to grow, helped by fee income and trading profits, and asset quality remains excellent, ANZ said.</p>
</text>
